T376	Cue 63027 63035	answered
T377	Entity 63036 63043	Solomon
T378	Entity 63070 63081	the speaker
T379	Quotation 63083 63399	"Though Varlamov is a Russian, he is at heart a scabby Jew; money and gain are all he lives for, but I threw my money in the stove! I don't want money, or land, or sheep, and there is no need for people to be afraid of me and to take off their hats when I pass. So I am wiser than your Varlamov and more like a man!"
