T561	Entity 94219 94221	he
T562	Cue 94240 94251	croaked out
T563	Quotation 94264 94535	"I have no voice. It's a real misfortune. All last night and this morning I have been haunted by the trio 'Lord, have Mercy' that we sang at the wedding at Marionovsky's. It's in my head and in my throat. It seems as though I could sing it, but I can't; I have no voice."
T564	Entity 94536 94538	He
T565	Cue 94575 94582	went on
T566	Quotation 94584 94882	"For fifteen years I was in the choir. In all the Lugansky works there was, maybe, no one with a voice like mine. But, confound it, I bathed two years ago in the Donets, and I can't get a single note true ever since. I took cold in my throat. And without a voice I am like a workman without hands."
