T1004	Entity 148453 148456	him
T1005	Quotation 148458 148743	"such a housewife, clever and sensible. You wouldn't find another like her among simple folk in the whole province. She has gone away. . . . But she is missing me, I kno-ow! I know the little magpie. She said she would be back to-morrow by dinner-time. . . . And just think how queer!"
T1006	Entity 148744 148754	Konstantin
T1007	Cue 148755 148793	almost shouted, speaking a note higher
T1008	Quotation 148821 148894	"Now she loves me and is sad without me, and yet she would not marry me."
